## Hints for Future Agents
Verified empirically that ~/.claude/rules/*.md auto-loads without any @import
from ~/.claude/CLAUDE.md. Evidence: CLAUDE_global.md contained zero @ lines,
yet all seven rules files were present in the session context at startup. If
that behavior ever changes, global rules silently stop loading and there is no
CLAUDE.md left to import them. That is the main risk this commit introduces.

